@title Part picker thumbnails at the large window size
@area Parts
@sizes 1920x1080
# Lane V5 follow-up. Select a device, open Part > Choose... in the Inspector
# (the selection sheet and the Cables drawer use the same list): each part with a clear kind (contactor, fuse, lamp...)
# shows its symbol as a small picture; others show none rather than a guess.
click_text "Open example"
wait 20
click 580 322
wait 8
click_text "Change..."
wait 8
shot picker
check_layout
key Escape
wait 6
